  newpath tMatrix currentmatrix pop ulx rad add uly rad add translate
  rad rad scale 0 0 1 90 270 arc tMatrix setmatrix lrx rad sub lry rad
  sub translate rad rad scale 0 0 1 270 90 arc tMatrix setmatrix
